0..75 Comment "// A receive\'s payload written in parentheses reads as the payload whatever"
76..153 Comment "// type it holds, as a send\'s does, a sum among them (#1229). The receive and"
154..230 Comment "// the unknown type share the tile `?`, and the parenthesis after it settles"
231..305 Comment "// the receive: the unknown type is a whole type, and no type form goes on"
306..328 Comment "// with `(` after one."
